    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:49b18e3fb3f9ec7b",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "fbcfc21888a47e227b548b1014ce1d26513eec755d45e2d5552e55b5b7c7e179",
      "text": "Breakfast in the hotel. We will drive the border of Bolivia for our jeep tour in Uyuni.\n\nDrive toward Hito Cajón, admire the Green Lagoon and enjoy the panoramic view of the Licancabur Volcano. Cross the Dali Valley, enjoy the Polkes hot springs and admire the “Sol de Mañana” geysers. Continue towards the Red Lagoon where you will observe many Andean flamingos, you will see the Árbol de Piedra and (Stone Tree) and arrival at “Ojo de Perdiz”.\n\nAccommodation: Desert Hotel, room with private bathroom (Box Lunch, Dinner)",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "1_2CgalLCI_e-m5DrGzaGrwAEVyfOj-ZB",
